// Package-owned allocation strategies over explicit qualified Extent backing.
// Bump allocates from its tail; release returns retired storage without
// rewinding. Reset consumes the complete returned prefix and remaining tail.
// Checked core split/merge operations conserve both Granted and Vacant;
// neither scalar geometry nor a strategy counter creates backing authority.
// Resident values must be extracted or cleaned before their space is reset.
//
// The executable package consumer is tests/omega/pass/memory/bump_allocator_canary.
// vec.omg is the growable-container customer of this allocation contract.
use bump;
use vec;
